WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.590
Look up on a clear night,
and you'll see stars:

2
00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.330
tiny points of light.

3
00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.110
Our Sun is a star too.

4
00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:10.190
It just looks bigger
because it is much closer.

5
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:13.650
But when you look at a star,
what are you really seeing?

6
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.930
Are you seeing it as it
is right now, tonight?

7
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.410
In this mission, you'll zoom
out from our solar system to our

8
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:25.050
galaxy, the Milky Way, and on
to billions of other galaxies.

9
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.290
And you'll meet the light year.

10
00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.630
Is it a time, or a distance?

11
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.970
Your mission: find out what you
are really seeing when you look

12
00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:34.180
at a star.
